        {
          "id": 522480467,
          "type": null,
          "body": "I suppose 45 KiB is OK-ish. Back of the envelope calculations for 2000 protocols that would be 90MiB. Large but not crazy large.\n\nBut I think we will need to rethink this approach to testing. Using the textual output of tshark like this is not viable IMO. It isn't guaranteed to be stable. Not a fan of adding heuristics tests either,\n\nI'll go ahead and merge this. The rest is something that needs discussion.",
